WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.270
Keep on holding me

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.270
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:09.150
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:09.150
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:21.960
If I reach out in the light, I can touch

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:21.960
Hikari no naka ni te wo sashinobaseba todoku

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:27.130
The precious arms

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:27.130
Anna ni motomete ita kakegae no nai ude e

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:32.130
I have been searching for so hard

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:32.130
Anna ni motomete ita kakegae no nai ude e

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:39.470
I turn around and the sky of blue

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:39.470
Furimukeba kodoku ni wa

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:48.940
Smiles down upon my solitude

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:48.940
Sora ga aoku hohoende kureru

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:56.200
In the darkness, I nearly lose sight of my dreams

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:56.200
Kurayami ni yume wo miushinai sou ni naru

00:00:56.740 --> 00:01:04.120
But if you remain by my side

00:00:56.740 --> 00:01:04.120
Demo anata ga itekureru no nara

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:08.420
Keep on holding me

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:08.420
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:12.090
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:12.090
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:19.260
I want to protect this love for always

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:19.260
Itsudemo kono omoi wo mamoritai no

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:24.600
This love...

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:24.600
Omoi wo

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:38.740
Sleeping Beauty, huh?

00:01:40.370 --> 00:01:43.450
She's a Ryna sapien who lived with Kurau.

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:45.910
Kurau called her Christmas.

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:50.840
F-Forgive me...

00:01:51.340 --> 00:01:55.970
for not being able to save you two!

00:02:21.910 --> 00:02:23.240
Christmas...

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:27.620
Wait for me... I'm coming to save you.

00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:33.380
The Voice That Calls You

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:50.270
Inspector Wong!

00:02:57.490 --> 00:02:59.700
We've completed equipping the pods.

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:00.910
I see...

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:05.030
We removed the limiter on the AR System
to increase irradiation time.

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:08.620
If irradiated continuously,
it will be effective even on Kurau.

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:10.580
Do you think she'll come?

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:11.670
Yes, she will.

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:16.130
Just like other Ryna sapiens,
she will most definitely come.

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:17.670
To save one of her own!

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:20.800
That's true.

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:29.390
Doug, is that the Rynax research facility?

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:32.560
I'll forward the map. Check it out.

00:03:35.270 --> 00:03:41.990
According to our reports, Rynax research and
experiments are conducted at the blinking tower.

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:43.280
This is probably where...

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:45.410
Christmas...

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:47.120
Don't be hasty, Kurau.

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:48.290
I know.

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:52.000
I can't save Christmas with the powers I have now.

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:54.130
I need your help too, Doug.

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:57.920
I'll be there shortly. Lay low till then.

00:03:57.920 --> 00:03:59.050
Okay.

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:01.760
Good girl. I'll see you later...

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:03.550
Make sure you wait for me, okay?

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:04.680
Okay.

00:04:08.890 --> 00:04:10.220
That's not on the map...

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:13.480
GPO?

00:04:17.110 --> 00:04:18.320
She's there...

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:21.150
Christmas is there...

00:04:42.130 --> 00:04:43.590
I'm sorry, Doug.

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:05.400
All right, you're cleared to go.

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:10.870
A dead end...

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:17.380
I can't use my powers until the last second.

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:21.250
If I get to where I can't move again,
I'll definitely be in trouble this time.

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:49.490
Where's the doctor?

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:51.370
He's examining R-27 right now.

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:16.480
Is this... Christmas?

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:19.600
No, there are more.

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:24.730
What does this mean?

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:38.620
I don't know...

00:06:39.170 --> 00:06:40.210
Where is she?

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:42.670
Christmas...

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:46.800
What's the situation?

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:49.340
Positioning the teams is 80% complete.

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:51.890
The surveillance systems
are currently being rechecked.

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:55.260
We won't let Kurau escape this time.

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:57.770
Stay calm now.

00:06:57.770 --> 00:06:58.680
Yes, ma'am!

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:07.490
Kimura! Show me the monitor images
you have of this floor!

00:07:07.490 --> 00:07:08.280
Yes, ma'am!

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:13.200
Don't tell me she's already gotten in?!

00:07:13.870 --> 00:07:15.870
Kimura! Zoom in on number 29!

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:16.990
Yes, ma'am!

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:20.370
Kurau!

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:28.840
Target confirmed. Moving from Block E to Block F.

00:07:31.220 --> 00:07:33.300
Detective! We're ready.

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:34.550
We're tracking the target.

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:37.010
Set up shields through passage points in order.

00:07:37.010 --> 00:07:38.350
Don't let her off this floor!

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:39.060
Roger!

00:07:39.060 --> 00:07:40.560
Kimura! What's her location?

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:41.560
Yes, ma'am!

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:43.350
Tracking data is in!

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:45.820
Christmas! Where are you?!

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:47.860
Where are you?!

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:52.410
You!

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:54.240
Hold it right there!

00:07:54.820 --> 00:07:55.830
Ayaka!

00:07:55.830 --> 00:07:57.490
This is bad! That way is...

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:04.750
Christmas... She's nearby?!

00:08:06.590 --> 00:08:08.670
In there... Christmas!

00:08:19.350 --> 00:08:20.350
Stop right there!

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:23.980
Surrender, Ryna sapien!

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:25.980
You're powerless here.

00:08:28.110 --> 00:08:31.280
Christmas... I'm sorry! Wait for me!

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:39.490
Ayaka!

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:41.660
Ayaka!

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:46.500
That was reckless!
Jumping out without an AR system!

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:48.040
Kimura.

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:48.880
Yes, ma'am?

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:50.920
Let's go get her!

00:08:58.550 --> 00:09:00.100
My cell phone...

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:00.930
Doug?!

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:06.770
There she is! At the end of the
connecting corridor in Block A!

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:14.780
Christmas...

00:09:14.780 --> 00:09:16.700
What the heck is this building?!

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:33.710
Ryna sapien!

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:36.800
It's over.

00:09:50.610 --> 00:09:53.480
She may get up after one hit.

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:55.240
Keep firing even after she's down.

00:09:55.240 --> 00:09:56.070
Yes, ma'am!

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:04.500
Kurau!

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:06.580
Doug?!

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:09.210
Jump on! Kurau!

00:10:10.840 --> 00:10:12.380
Pod unit, what the hell are you doing?

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:13.750
The pilots are boarding now.

00:10:14.670 --> 00:10:17.050
They can be airborne in thirty seconds.

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:18.840
This is bad.

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:20.510
Irradiate AR System!

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:24.010
What are you doing?! Hurry up!

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:24.770
Go!
What are you doing?! Hurry up!

00:10:24.770 --> 00:10:24.850
Go!

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:26.140
You got it!

00:10:32.110 --> 00:10:33.110
Damn...

00:10:34.940 --> 00:10:37.820
Kurau! Didn't I tell you to wait for me?

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:40.660
But Christmas was in there!

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:45.200
So she was, but who the hell told you to
go in there alone?!

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:50.080
What's done is done! We need to regroup.

00:10:50.370 --> 00:10:53.460
We gotta shake off our pursuers. Get in!

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:16.360
To all units, this is the command vehicle.

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:18.490
Don't fire without orders!

00:11:18.490 --> 00:11:20.200
Our goal is to capture her!

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:22.870
Jeez, didn't you learn anything in training?

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:38.800
Come out, Kurau.

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:42.510
The situation is no longer in your favor.

00:11:46.810 --> 00:11:49.930
AR system... Fire!

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:03.320
Ayaka! Look!

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:05.320
There's only one person on board!

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:06.490
Impossible!

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:08.410
Headquarters! Is everything okay over there?

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:11.290
This is headquarters. Everything is fine.

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:12.210
What's wrong?

00:12:12.210 --> 00:12:13.120
Kimura!

00:12:12.870 --> 00:12:14.040
Y-yes, ma'am!

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:16.790
Search the area. Kurau
must've gotten off midway!

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:17.340
What?!

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:39.570
The alarm didn't go off.

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:53.580
Christmas!

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:00.880
What's this?

00:13:03.630 --> 00:13:04.840
Christmas!

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:07.010
Christmas!

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:19.020
Christmas... Christmas...

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:20.320
Christmas!

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:21.980
Christmas!

00:13:47.890 --> 00:13:49.140
Christmas!

00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:03.110
Kurau...

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:14.660
What?!

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:17.870
Why?

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:24.170
Give yourself up already, Doug!

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:25.880
Do you think you can get away?!

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:29.640
Why, Ayaka? Why is the GPO after Kurau?

00:14:29.640 --> 00:14:31.350
Because she's dangerous.

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:34.100
How could we let someone so dangerous go free?

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:37.430
Dangerous? She's dangerous
because you chase her!

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:41.690
Those two were happy on that island.

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:45.530
They were fine until you showed up.

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:48.400
You're the one who drove Kurau into a corner!

00:14:49.450 --> 00:14:51.530
You have no idea what's going on.

00:14:51.530 --> 00:14:52.910
What?!

00:14:52.910 --> 00:14:55.540
Well then, what do you know about Kurau?!

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:57.830
What do you know about Christmas?!

00:14:57.830 --> 00:14:59.210
Doug...

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:03.250
What do YOU know? About those two...

00:15:03.840 --> 00:15:05.380
Former Officer Doug,

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:08.800
there's nothing I can learn from you any more.

00:15:07.420 --> 00:15:09.220
This is the command vehicle.

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:11.340
Report to Inspector Wong...

00:15:11.340 --> 00:15:13.300
Kurau has been captured!

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:20.560
No way... Kurau...

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:22.730
Damn!

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:28.280
Coming through!

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:50.380
Dad...

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:52.340
Kurau...

00:15:57.680 --> 00:16:02.480
Kurau, this was the only way I could talk to you.

00:16:04.020 --> 00:16:05.860
Please surrender.

00:16:05.860 --> 00:16:08.570
And please help us.

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:11.860
We don't want to hurt you two.

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:14.160
It's too late for that now!

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:15.910
I don't want you to die!

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:20.870
Please come to us... to this research facility.

00:16:20.870 --> 00:16:23.830
Are you going to research my body again?

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:25.630
I won't allow that.

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:29.130
Dr. Amami will be in full charge of you two.

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:32.970
I won't let anyone hurt you.

00:16:32.970 --> 00:16:35.430
So please stay here.

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:38.560
You won't have to run any more.

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:42.310
Here, you can live together with your family.

00:16:49.900 --> 00:16:51.740
I don't blame you for not believing me.

00:16:52.190 --> 00:16:55.860
But Kurau, please believe me.

00:16:56.780 --> 00:16:57.620
I beg you!

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:01.080
Together...

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:07.040
With Dad...

00:17:08.590 --> 00:17:11.090
Maybe that's best...

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:15.090
If I can stay with Christmas...

00:17:15.260 --> 00:17:16.640
Kurau...

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:21.640
Kurau... Leave it up to me.

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:25.850
I'll make sure that you and Dr. Amami can live in peace.

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:31.110
And of course, I'll personally guarantee
the safety of your Pair.

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:32.480
So...

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:34.150
No!

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:35.780
Doctor!

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:37.160
You mustn't stay here.

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:40.200
If you do, you'll be research subjects again.

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:41.910
You and Christmas!

00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:48.830
That girl... Neither the GPO nor I
can protect Christmas.

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:50.920
The only one who can is you, Kurau!

00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:53.840
Dad...

00:17:56.760 --> 00:18:04.850
Lonely freedom...

00:18:06.020 --> 00:18:08.520
Come on, Christmas...

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:16.700
Lonely freedom...

00:18:09.770 --> 00:18:11.020
Kurau...

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:13.900
Wait!

00:18:17.360 --> 00:18:26.870
Lonely freedom...

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:37.220
Lonely freedom...

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:37.880
Run, Kurau! With your powers,
you can get out of here!

00:18:37.880 --> 00:18:39.510
Doctor! What are you saying?!

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:47.520
Lonely freedom...

00:18:39.510 --> 00:18:41.090
Don't worry about me!

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:43.100
Dad...

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:48.520
Don't give up, Kurau!

00:18:48.140 --> 00:18:57.610
Lonely freedom...

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:56.150
Kurau!

00:18:56.360 --> 00:18:57.320
Dad!

00:18:57.860 --> 00:18:58.780
"Dad"?!

00:18:58.570 --> 00:19:05.410
Lonely freedom...

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:00.160
Hurry!

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:11.040
Deploy all pods! Dispatch all the guards too!

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:18.420
Lonely freedom...

00:19:11.040 --> 00:19:11.960
Yes, ma'am!

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:15.420
Get outta my way! Coming through!

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:16.420
Doug!

00:19:16.420 --> 00:19:19.630
We're bustin' out! Hang on tight!

00:19:22.180 --> 00:19:24.220
Yahoo!

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:47.620
Inspector Wong,

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:51.710
no one told me you were planning
to use that girl as a decoy.

00:19:52.870 --> 00:19:55.460
Why did you not tell me?

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:00.300
I'm going after them.

00:20:10.520 --> 00:20:13.900
Please replay that part again!

00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:20.940
Kurau, go on ahead.

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:23.820
I'm gonna go hide that big giant.

00:20:23.860 --> 00:20:24.870
Doug...

00:20:24.870 --> 00:20:26.620
So YOU'RE Doug!

00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:30.330
I'll meet up with you later. Keep in touch.

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:33.210
I'm glad to finally meet you.

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:34.960
I am grateful.

00:20:35.790 --> 00:20:36.630
Doug...

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:42.050
Um... I promise I'll wait for you this time.

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:43.590
Yeah.

00:20:44.760 --> 00:20:46.340
Thanks, Doug.

00:20:48.050 --> 00:20:48.890
Yeah.

00:20:59.150 --> 00:21:00.110
Well, then...

00:21:02.940 --> 00:21:05.030
Let's see now...

00:21:13.330 --> 00:21:16.540
There's just one place we can hide.

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:21.050
I thought I would have to go there one day.

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:26.470
Okay, let's go.

00:21:39.940 --> 00:21:46.910
From a great distance

00:21:39.940 --> 00:21:46.910
Tooku haruka kanata kara

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:56.250
You smile at me

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:56.250
Kimi ga hohoemu you ni

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:05.420
The hopelessness that lingers from the past

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:05.420
Kako kara tsuzuku hakanasa

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:14.470
Is depicted in silence

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:14.470
Shizuka ni utsushi dasarete

00:22:16.770 --> 00:22:23.730
Moonlight, please never change

00:22:16.770 --> 00:22:23.730
Moonlight kawarazu ni ite

00:22:25.860 --> 00:22:32.830
Moonlight, I'll come to see you

00:22:25.860 --> 00:22:32.830
Moonlight ai ni yuku Kimi ni

00:22:35.000 --> 00:22:41.960
Moonlight, I'll come running up and surely

00:22:35.000 --> 00:22:41.960
Moonlight kakenobori kitto

00:22:44.130 --> 00:22:51.090
Moonlight, we'll be able to meet again

00:22:44.130 --> 00:22:51.090
Moonlight mou ichido aeru

00:22:53.310 --> 00:23:00.310
Moonlight

00:22:53.310 --> 00:23:00.310
Moonlight

00:23:09.900 --> 00:23:11.910
Next Episode

00:23:10.860 --> 00:23:17.660
I heard from Dr. Amami that those Ryna sapiens 
you're after started out as victims themselves.

00:23:17.870 --> 00:23:20.040
They have dangerous powers.

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:22.750
Powers like that cannot be left loose.

00:23:21.920 --> 00:23:24.880
Here Right Now
